"On the translation side, we have 20 languages fully supported: Basque, "
"Brazilian Portuguese, Breton, British English, Catalan, Chinese Traditional, "
"Dutch, French, Galician, Greek, Italian, Macedonian, Malayalam, Polish, "
"Portuguese, Romanian, Slovak, Spanish, Swedish, Ukrainian."
